cd backend
venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
```

**Terminal 2 — Frontend:**
```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev
```

### **Access Points**

| Service | URL |
|---|---|
| Frontend | http://localhost:5173 |
| Backend API | http://localhost:8000 |
| Swagger Docs | http://localhost:8000/docs |
