- **Fully responsive** — mobile, tablet, desktop
- **Color-coded agents** — Buyer (blue), Seller (red), Pricing (green), Contract (purple)

### 📊 Real-Time Visualization
- **Live negotiation chat** view
- **Price movement chart** (round-by-round)
